		{
			description: [
				"&r欢迎来到&9&lCompanions&r，一个用&a&l10种可驯服的生物&r丰富你世界的模组，每种都拥有特殊能力。该模组还引入了具有独特技能的新&c&l敌对生物&r、新的&7&l武器&r、一个Boss以及更多内容。"
				""
				"你的冒险始于找到这些友善的生物之一。请记住，伙伴有三种状态（游荡、坐下和跟随），可以用&a&l小精华&r和&a&l大精华&r（通过击杀敌对生物获得）来治疗它们。找到你的第一个伙伴，开始你的旅程吧！"
			]
			id: "171D30BB0B64E741"
			subtitle: "&f&l探索&9&lCompanions&f&l模组，找到你的第一个忠实盟友。&r"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7E83B92DC680BD9D"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&6&l任务：&r&e欢迎来到伙伴！"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["171D30BB0B64E741"]
			description: ["&rCraft the &e&lGreat Chalice&r using &7&lcopper ingots&r, similar to how you would craft a cauldron. Fill the block by interacting with it using &a&lgreat essence&r or &a&lsmall essence&r, both obtained by killing monsters. When completely full, interact with an &6&lempty grail&r to obtain a filled grail, an item required for some recipes."]
			id: "7CD678A8B69D69E0"
			subtitle: "&f&l制作&e&l大杯&f&l并用精华填满它。&r"
			tasks: [{
				id: "523C443B841B78BC"
				item: "knightlib:great_chalice"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6&l任务：&r&e精华收集者"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7CD678A8B69D69E0"]
			description: ["&r&e&lSoul Mage&r无法自然生成。在沼泽中找到一只&6&lGolden Allay&r，给予它法师的衣物（外套和帽子）以及一根&7&lstaff&r即可将其转化。为法师提供&5&lmagic books&r，并在&e&lSoul Furnace&r中烹饪糖果以生成&6&lLiving Candle&r。当&6&lLiving Candle&r与法师绑定后，它将保护法师免受致命伤害。"]
			icon: "companions:mage_staff"
			id: "212C1B36E8C5517D"
			subtitle: "&f&lTransform an Allay&f&l into a &e&lSoul Mage&f&l and bond it with a Living Candle.&r"
			tasks: [{
