			x: -2.0d
			y: 2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7CD678A8B69D69E0"]
			description: ["&rObtain a &e&lCroissant Egg&r by cooking a &e&lBig Bread&r in a &e&lSoul Furnace&r. Hatch the egg to get the &e&lCroissant Dragon&r companion. Feed it three buckets of &f&lmilk&r to grow it until it can be tamed. Although its attacks deal no damage, they will slow down hostile mobs."]
			icon: "companions:big_bread"
			id: "2E9896A88F3B8C27"
